> **Length cap**: 1 page (~250-400 words).
> **Voice**: keep Nii's voice per `profile/style_guide.md`.
> **Hard rules**: never invent anything. Address gaps only when they materially matter.

## Structure to produce

```markdown
# Nii Amon Dsane

[Date]

[Hiring Manager Name or Hiring Team]
[Title]
{{COMPANY}}

[Greeting appropriate to the context]

[Short opening that states why this role is relevant. Do not manufacture a hook.]

[One or two short paragraphs using the most relevant facts from Nii's work. Use real metrics only when useful. Connect the evidence to the role without repeating the JD.]

[Optional: address one material gap directly if match_analysis.md says it needs handling.]

